OL,5,G0115 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FA young man is treated for a
OL,7,     Fsevere reaction to a recreational
OL,8,     Fdrug, while 65-year-old Christine
OL,9,     Ffrom Camberwell is brought in to
OL,10,     FKing's by her friends after
OL,11,     Fbanging her head.
OL,12,G0220 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FThis moving episode looks at the
OL,14,     Fstart and end of life, as well as
OL,15,     Fthe joys and fears of living
OL,16,     Falone. Graham, who's 75, has been
OL,17,     Fattacked. Mum Cheryl has two
OL,18,     Fpoorly boys.
